(text "U503 takes all eight data bits from 1.8 V to 3.3 V. U504 translates the clocks and controls." (at 16 132.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 0449d2a2-d368-5c6a-88bb-348b430fb045))
(text "TI AXC8 function table: DIR1=0, DIR2=0 gives both banks B to A. Both high gives A1:4 to B and B5:8 to A." (at 16 137.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid f1c5f189-abef-5be7-a8cd-e5701ae10c43))
(text "R508 damps XCLK at U504. R509 damps the translated PCLK at U504. Scope clocks at both receiving ends." (at 16 142.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 8e2ca778-6455-5f7b-befe-99f5c8a64df1))
(text "Use the sensor color-bar pattern to set the sampling edge in firmware and confirm lane order at the selected PCLK." (at 16 147.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid ed83d1e6-d594-50ed-9f9b-09ea2cf6f32b))
(embedded_fonts no))
